[SIZE="4"][B]Installation[/B][/SIZE]

[COLOR="Red"][B]Back up everything first (at least /data and the boot partition). Make sure the phone is an E400.[/B][/COLOR]

[LIST=1]
[*]Install a custom recovery ([URL="https://xdaforums.com/t/recovery-unofficial-twrp-3-1-1-0-3-for-lg-optimus-l3-e400.4806725/"]TWRP for the E400[/URL]).
[*]Copy the ROM ZIP to the phone.
[*]Boot into TWRP and make a backup.
[*]Wipe data/factory reset, cache and Dalvik cache (needed the first time you come from stock).
[*]Install the ZIP, wipe cache and Dalvik cache again and reboot. The first boot takes about a minute.
[/LIST]

[COLOR="Red"][SIZE="5"][CENTER]Do not mirror the download without permission.[/CENTER][/SIZE][/COLOR]

