[SIZE="4"][B]What is different from other attempts[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]Stock V10c kernel instead of a rebuilt one (only one instruction patched, for FM). A different kernel gave green frames in the camera and broken MDP.
[*]Stock gralloc, copybit and camera HAL blobs. The camera uses a small wrapper over the stock LG HAL.
[*]Stock RIL blobs. Some of the telephony blobs I started from came from another firmware and were replaced with the V10c ones.
[*]Every change outside the device tree is a small patch in patches/apply-patches.sh.
[/LIST]

[SIZE="4"][B]Notes for developers[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*]ueventd on this device loads ueventd.lge.rc (it uses the first word of the cpuinfo "Hardware" line), so ueventd.e0.rc is never read.
[*]debug.composition.type=mdp is not optional with the stock gralloc; without it only the status bar is drawn.
[*]HeadsetObserver must read /sys/class/switch/h2w_headset.
[*]The card status of the stock RIL carries three subscription indexes (GSM, CDMA, IMS).
[*]docs/E400_NOTES.md in the device tree has the build notes, root causes and the comparison with the stock ROM.
[/LIST]

