[*]Headset detected at boot and audio routed to the headset.
[*]RIL aligned with the stock V10c blobs; SIM reaches READY/LOADED.
[*]FM radio working: analog DAC configuration, fminit and the FM app included, and the stock kernel's radio driver deadlock patched (see known issues).
